            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention discloses a consumable sheet-product level monitoring dispenser for association with a single brand of sheet-product (10) filled consumable in a disposable purchase container (12), comprising: a receiver (14) for receiving the consumable within the disposable purchase container (12) upon insertion thereto of the disposable purchase container (12); at least two distinct types of proximity sensors (22) associated with, positioned proximate to, and configured to sense across at least one opening (20) in the receiver (14) to reconcile misreads between each other; a sensing module configured to receive sheet-product level data (200) from the at least two distinct types of proximity sensors (22) only if the disposable purchase container is from the single brand as indicated by a marking on the disposable purchase container; a communications module (202) configured to communicate the sheet-product level to at least a mobile device display (210) and over at least one network (206) to at least one back end module (204); and an app (230) configured to display on the mobile device display (210) and configured to communicate with the communication module (202), wherein the app (230) is configured to provide a confirmation of an automated replenishment order based on the sheet level of the sheet-product, and is configured to provide a discount with the automated replenishment order.</p>
            </abstract>
